{"title":"Silver Scimitar","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Weapon Smithing Lv 22) · Monster drop: Dune Raider, Hill Giant Adolescent, Dune Skirmisher</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 15 · STR 45 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Weapon Smithing at level 22 <span class=\"muted\">(748 XP)</span> from 5× <a href=\"#/item/silver-bar\">Silver Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-raider\" title=\"Dune Raider - Normal, 4.5% of recorded drops (1 / 22 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/df6ebb3872ba169f9ab2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Raider</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4.5%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-adolescent\" title=\"Hill Giant Adolescent - Normal, 0.5% of recorded drops (1 / 184 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9beef5a6d257406a5827.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hill Giant Adolescent</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.5%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - Normal, 0.1% of recorded drops (1 / 936 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.1%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"silver-scimitar\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/weapon-smithing\">Weapon smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/silver-scimitar\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/silver-scimitar?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/silver-scimitar?q=crude\">Crude <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/silver-scimitar?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/silver-scimitar?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/silver-scimitar?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/silver-scimitar?q=excellent\">Excellent <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on q-superior\" href=\"#/item/silver-scimitar?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/silver-scimitar?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"silver-scimitar\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"corrode\">Corrosion</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Damage below is the weapon alone, before your stats and enchantments.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>vs Ordinary</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-scimitar?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/